# Where "Open The App" points while developing.
#
# apps/deliberation on 5174 - the redesign, not apps/web on 5173. That port pin
# is in apps/deliberation/vite.config.ts alongside the /api proxy, and the proxy
# is the reason this has to be the dev server rather than a built copy: the app
# is a client for a service and renders nothing without /api behind it.
#
# No fragment. apps/web needed one because its useful screen was #/case rather
# than its default tab; this app's default route IS the dashboard, and an
# unauthenticated arrival is sent to sign-in by the app itself. Pointing at a
# deep link here would only skip the step that decides which case to open.
#
# Committed on purpose: it holds no secret, and without it `npm run landing:dev`
# links to /app/, which does not exist on the dev server.
VITE_APP_URL="http://localhost:5174/"
